{"availability":"available","full":"takuyajodai/edge-aura","name":"edge-aura","description":"An organic glow that hugs the edge of your screen — zero-dependency Canvas 2D engine + React adapter","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":87,"forks":6,"created":"2026-07-07T08:07:04Z","updated":"2026-07-18T04:24:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://edge-aura-xi.vercel.app","topics":["animation","canvas","effects","glow","react","typescript","ui"],"demo":"https://edge-aura.js.org/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:02:48.481Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:02:48.481Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:02:48.481Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:12.317Z","stars":87,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-11T02:06:50.669Z","stars":87,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:46:43.345Z","stars":87,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:02:48.481Z","stars":87,"forks":6}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An organic screen-edge glow, inspired by the ambient edge glows of on-device assistants (e.g. Apple's Siri): a rounded-rectangle \"neon tube\" hugging the viewport edges — a bright undulating core line plus a soft asymmetric bloom whose inner face dissolves with no perceptible end. The hue cycles continuously around the ring; tap, keystroke, and save-pulse inputs inject energy that swells localized hotspots through spring physics.","The core engine is framework-agnostic (plain TypeScript + Canvas 2D, zero dependencies, no React imports). A React adapter is provided as a separate import path. Born in production — extracted from the editor of a live product."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/takuyajodai/edge-aura/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9e71ed2d68361475ace260ad53ec97ba32c6d66d77a85632dba924fa64bce2a4","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:12.425Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:43.445Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An organic screen-edge glow, in